<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-26T02:57:34.942Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:57:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant attacks continue across Nigeria, with suspected militants killing at least 30 people in Niger state and bandits abducting residents in Kaduna and Borno, prompting President Tinubu to vow rescue of abducted schoolchildren and challenge terrorists to surrender. Gunmen in Plateau killed an illegal mining dealer, stole mineral products, and attacked a herders' livestock, while Berom militiamen killed a cow in a separate livestock raid. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUW5aeXpDUldIYjR5RlZ2bVdyUHFKZUtRcEUwTERNc3ZTRVFWTlNRSEZjV05VMVNyNG1KTXZNelVaQUJVaUlObUlqYXl5MV85b0hrTDdJMlA4YVcyanRXVVhrV19vUjBqRmR2WDBzcnY2MlFsTjdoS0paNGFTQWdESk5Lcm9GeWNSbUN6dkJwbDhwWk5WR1FqWXVWS1dYVjFVcElvNDd2RS11NnprbVVUdWl3cVVkVC16?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOWWUtejR0cEUzbV82QmpPcm1KMXNYd2M4YWNna0d0aTZDdlYwaWsxN2RSY0U0VVdEVGZ0ZFNyakF4OG50TmRWMF9UWFZ1VE5vQUlHdWxEdEpiZkVxaEJzMThRUkVuRGdCVnU2S2ZOTS1ZOVZRZFJwMW56dGpUMEhpUUhmUkNicTVjWjd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9lUlJ3NmI1bllOZzgxSlo2Z0lHaFlsZF9qcDlmajV5VzQxTF9RY1BDMGNFdUxBdk04RHFkOXg0dlRsRXAtUU5VdWF4bktuOGRSNWo4ZHJwOW9nMjI3c0FNWU5UZDdBMjF1SFhNWVBLY3FFajByZXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNREJaS29Dc3Fyb0U4Rl9uQ3RyNTF4QnNoSlU4Q3p1QUVaOXdKZ1hmcjdGWEpkd3c1cEZHOEFKaG01R0kwV3dVREZFalZZVHhjWWZlWmEtUE41X05ONFc1dmNiMnpQSlpSY0xGMHhCdFctMDZ5cUhpZ3oxWnVnLVBpWjV1S1pQYnVQVEI5eU